<title>FINLAND: P.SANOMAT SAYS PLAUTTUS HAS 43 PCT STAKE.</title>
<headline>P.SANOMAT SAYS PLAUTTUS HAS 43 PCT STAKE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish media group Pohjolan Sanomat Oy said in a statement on Wednesday Plauttus Oy had acquired 42.5 percent of its shares and 26.4 percent of its votes from several sellers.</p>
<p>&quot;Plauttus has not earlier held Pohjolan Sanomat's shares,&quot; Pohjolan Sanomat said.  </p>
<p>The company said Plauttus paid about 9.1 million markka for 334,800 A shares and 186,367 K shares.</p>
<p>Pohjolan Sanomat said that its articles of association prevented any shareholder from using more than 1/50 of the votes represented at a shareholders' meeting.</p>
<p>The company did not name the individuals or companies behind Plauttus.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
